{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25788","headline":"寿阳罢郡日有诗十首与追怀不殊今编於後兼纪瑞物 发寿阳分司勅到又遇新正感怀书事 · 李绅","name":"寿阳罢郡日有诗十首与追怀不殊今编於後兼纪瑞物 发寿阳分司勅到又遇新正感怀书事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"休爲建隼临淝守，转作垂丝入洛人。\n罢阅旧林三载籍，又开新历四年春。\n云遮北雁愁行客，柳起东风慰病身。\n渐喜雪霜消解尽，得随风水到天津。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李绅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25788.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25788","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}